{"type":"npc","name":"Amplifighter","folder":null,"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":130,"temp":0,"max":130,"details":""},"ac":{"value":29,"details":"(25 when at 65 HP or fewer), hard core"},"allSaves":{"value":"+1 status to all saves vs. auditory"},"speed":{"value":25,"otherSpeeds":[],"details":""},"immunities":[{"type":"bleed","exceptions":[]},{"type":"death-effects","exceptions":[]},{"type":"disease","exceptions":[]},{"type":"doomed","exceptions":[]},{"type":"drained","exceptions":[]},{"type":"fatigued","exceptions":[]},{"type":"healing","exceptions":[]},{"type":"nonlethal-attacks","exceptions":[]},{"type":"paralyzed","exceptions":[]},{"type":"poison","exceptions":[]},{"type":"sickened","exceptions":[]},{"type":"spirit","exceptions":[]},{"type":"unconscious","exceptions":[]},{"type":"vitality","exceptions":[]},{"type":"void","exceptions":[]}],"weaknesses":[{"type":"sonic","value":10,"exceptions":[]}],"resistances":[]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["chthonian","common","empyrean","melodian","protean","utopian"],"details":""},"level":{"value":9},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>Amplifighters are part of a loud, provocative subculture of automata. Capable tinkers, they mod themselves into bulky, core-powered loudspeakers capable of producing a great deal of noise, some of which might even be considered music. Their reinforced, sound-boosting bodies are flush with dials and inventively styled wires, which leave them vulnerable to external sonic energies. As such, amplifighters enjoy sparring amongst themselves, stopping to gloat and/or repair when their partner starts \"bleeding static.\"</p><p>An amplifighter's ambiance isn't to everyone's tastes, but they wouldn't care even if they could hear people's complaints over the constant thrumming of their cores. After all, regardless of whether they consider themselves more of an inventor or a bard, every amplifighter already knows that their avant-garde genius is sorely underappreciated.</p><h2>No Accounting For Taste</h2><p>As dissimilar as amplifighters seem to be from other constructs, the schisms between various subcultures of amplifighters are even more pronounced—at least to them! Amplifighters can argue for hours about who among them truly embodies \"deep liminal screechcore\" or the \"new-wave bleep\" style. When two groups of rival amplifighters meet, their arguments can even escalate to violence, resulting in a riotous cacophony that can be heard for miles around.</p><h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2><p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 90/200/360 gp</p><p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (bludgeoning, slashing), armor (medium, heavy), shield, skill items (Athletics, Crafting, Lore [Music], Performance)</p><p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> bane, charisma, elongating, energy resistant (spirit, vitality, void), intelligence, metal, music, sensory (low-light vision), strength, sturdy, throwing, wild</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Elemental Storm (Pathfinder)","authors":"Colette Martini","license":"ORC","remaster":true}},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":5},"dex":{"mod":3},"con":{"mod":4},"int":{"mod":6},"wis":{"mod":1},"cha":{"mod":5}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":14,"senses":[{"type":"low-light-vision"}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":21,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":18,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":14,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"athletics":{"base":18},"crafting":{"base":21},"performance":{"base":20}},"traits":{"value":["automaton"],"rarity":"rare","size":{"value":"med"}}},"_id":"G6RBUSzmvCzEWpTc","img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/portraits/amplifighter.webp","prototypeToken":{"name":"Amplifighter","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"width":1,"height":1,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-be